\id JON
\h Jonah
\toc1 The Book of Jonah
\mt1 Jonah
\rem Fixture: paired filler. Its 40 verses carry the project lane over
\rem min_verses 50, so the short RUT verse has a scope to be short in.
\c 1
\p
\v 1 The yoke dust’s sheep goat of the seed and the stone beside the pine in the linen.
\v 2 The shore dawn’s field of the shore and the harvest beside the road in the dove.
\v 3 The flame pasture’s yoke of the goat and the yoke beside the wick in the shore.
\v 4 The shore wall’s wool of the reed and the sand beside the rope in the sand.
\v 5 The dawn hillside seed’s hillside of the goat and the wall beside the cloak in the basket.
\v 6 The oil harvest’s of the wick and the dawn beside the gate in the pine.
\v 7 The fish bread’s basket of the bread and the valley beside the yoke in the linen.
\v 8 The sheep dawn yoke brick of the fish and the rope beside the cloak in the fig.
\v 9 The quail dawn of the reed and the knife beside the yoke in the wine.
\v 10 The hillside olive field of the yoke and the hillside beside the gate in the beam.
\v 11 The lamp furrow cloak oil of the road and the well beside the ox in the dust.
\v 12 The olive thorn spring dye of the stone and the wall beside the spring in the cloud.
\v 13 The orchard dawn vine wool of the gate and the grain beside the jar in the reed.
\v 14 The clay wine clay of the rope and the dye beside the oil in the quail.
\v 15 The ember water of the road and the knife beside the bread in the hillside.
\v 16 The beam salt of the wool and the lamp beside the orchard in the harvest.
\v 17 The bread flint of the orchard and the olive beside the olive in the olive.
\v 18 The sickle staff river of the ember and the wall beside the valley in the meadow.
\v 19 The beam sandal cloud clay of the flint and the briar beside the salt in the fish.
\v 20 The well rain beam vine of the ash and the river beside the yoke in the jar.
\c 2
\p
\v 1 The hillside cloud of the sickle and the dove beside the goat in the rain.
\v 2 The road stone reed of the clay and the net beside the sheep in the yoke.
\v 3 The valley field sandal dust of the well and the staff beside the ox in the brick.
\v 4 The seed quail of the dye and the rope beside the pasture in the clay.
\v 5 The tower thread of the grain and the fig beside the valley in the olive.
\v 6 The flame furrow beam harvest of the beam and the pasture beside the wick in the fig.
\v 7 The beam tower beam of the ash and the staff beside the ash in the sandal.
\v 8 The quail stone light of the knife and the fig beside the oil in the wind.
\v 9 The well hillside water wick of the rain and the ember beside the dawn in the grain.
\v 10 The valley plough rope hillside of the salt and the valley beside the spring in the plough.
\v 11 The wool flint vine well of the ash and the briar beside the wine in the meadow.
\v 12 The flint staff staff of the wine and the bread beside the lamp in the ember.
\v 13 The fish dye brick of the gate and the dawn beside the salt in the fish.
\v 14 The rain bread olive thorn of the sickle and the stone beside the orchard in the pasture.
\v 15 The oil vine salt of the valley and the meadow beside the thread in the wall.
\v 16 The wall net of the olive and the furrow beside the field in the bread.
\v 17 The plough fig water road of the flint and the wick beside the pasture in the wine.
\v 18 The bread dove clay orchard of the dust and the dawn beside the ash in the ember.
\v 19 The lamp wind orchard reed of the cloak and the pine beside the oil in the oil.
\v 20 The spring ash river brick of the wine and the cloud beside the flint in the yoke.
